{% Projects id="work" %}

{% Project title="kale and me" href="https://kaleandme-fastenprogramm.de/" linkText="juice cleanse app" color="#869B86"
mobile={"width":684,"height":1230,"poster":"/posters/kale-and-me-mobile.jpg","hls":"https://vod-cdn.lp-playback.studio/raw/jxf4iblf6wlsyor6526t4tcmtmqa/catalyst-vod-com/hls/21706dh3i6i9v2ik/index.m3u8"}
desktop={"width":1000,"height":438,"poster":"/posters/kale-and-me-desktop.jpg","hls":"https://vod-cdn.lp-playback.studio/raw/jxf4iblf6wlsyor6526t4tcmtmqa/catalyst-vod-com/hls/0b16fkj6v4uqsqkm/index.m3u8"} locale="en" %}

Development of a progressive web app for juice company [kale and me](https://www.kaleandme.de/). Design by [curilab](https://curilab.de/).

The app is meant to accompany customers during their 14 day juice cleanse.

*Forms* with [formik](https://formik.org/), *query caching* with [react-query](https://react-query.tanstack.com/) and *mobile-swipe* compatibility with [swiper.js](https://swiperjs.com/).

{% TechnologyButtons names=["adobe-xd","adobe-illustrator","nextjs","formik","react-query","docker","tailwindcss","swiperjs"] /%}

{% /Project %}

