{% Project title="coordinet" href="https://coordinet.plusquam.site" linkText="compare app" color="#E6EAEE"
mobile={"width":632,"height":1130,"poster":"/posters/coordinet-mobile.jpg","hls":"https://vod-cdn.lp-playback.studio/raw/jxf4iblf6wlsyor6526t4tcmtmqa/catalyst-vod-com/hls/4fe3r8szuskwvxtd/index.m3u8"}
desktop={"width":1200,"height":548,"poster":"/posters/coordinet-desktop.jpg","hls":"https://vod-cdn.lp-playback.studio/raw/jxf4iblf6wlsyor6526t4tcmtmqa/catalyst-vod-com/hls/5b503gym5j848em8/index.m3u8"} locale="en" %}

*Design* and *development* of a progressive web app for a client of [Coordinet](https://coordi.net/), an *IT consultancy*.

The app is meant to help customers *compare 3D printers* based on a *vast number of criteria*.

*Forms* with [formik](https://formik.org/), *query caching* with [react-query](https://react-query.tanstack.com/), *mobile-swipe* compatibility with [swiper.js](https://swiperjs.com/) and *state management* with [xstate](https://xstate.js.org/).

{% TechnologyButtons names=["figma","adobe-xd","adobe-illustrator","nextjs","formik","react-query","docker","tailwindcss","xstate","swiperjs"] /%}

{% /Project %}

